{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21625","headline":"贻蜀五首 张校书元夫 · 元稹","name":"贻蜀五首 张校书元夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未面西川张校书，书来稠叠颇相於。\n我闻声价金应敌，衆道风姿玉不如。\n远处从人须谨慎，少年爲事要舒徐。\n劝君便是酬君爱，莫比寻常赠鲤鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}